{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 4.195266337117737e-06, "latent1_max": 2.5538016416248865e-05, "latentT_mean": 1.333754093887383e-07, "latentT_max": 9.909548452924355e-07, "text": "看啥？随便。别是恐怖片，吓得我一宿睡不着。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.4950120778623647e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0001920784416142851, "latentT_mean": 9.53883152887467e-07, "latentT_max": 7.841586011636537e-06, "text": "啥都行，就怕吓着我这小胆儿。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 4.115579063129127e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0006314727943390608, "latentT_mean": 6.1396370258080715e-06, "latentT_max": 8.782020449871197e-05, "text": "编程啊，就跟吃屎一样难，值不值得得看个人兴趣了。我是鸟族，不会那种玩意儿。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.366474742466943e-06, "latent1_max": 4.492023435886949e-05, "latentT_mean": 7.595671861087354e-08, "latentT_max": 1.7432505501346895e-06, "text": "编程啊，这玩意儿嘛，说难也不难，说容易也不容易。不过要是真喜欢，肯定值得。反正我就喜欢捣鼓代码，挺有意思的。你呢，有啥兴趣爱好？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.527070487178839e-07, "latent1_max": 3.2887066936382325e-06, "latentT_mean": 4.8534890500238435e-09, "latentT_max": 9.619729013365941e-08, "text": "这还用说嘛，就是人多热闹，能拍照打卡的地方多，老板娘也随和，能喝到各种奇怪的口味。反正就是好玩儿呗。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.0817128497173017e-06, "latent1_max": 1.9672943381010555e-05, "latentT_mean": 3.205667077720713e-08, "latentT_max": 8.427439865954511e-07, "text": "谁知道啊，可能就是那个地方有好吃的东西呗，或者气氛好，或者是社交嘛。反正我就觉得那些地方人挤人，还不如在家喝杯热茶呢。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.0001702990289779742, "latent1_max": 0.0019166467245668173, "latentT_mean": 2.9714838316967653e-05, "latentT_max": 0.000476330314995721, "text": "鸟儿嘛，当然了。还有兔子，它们好像也喜欢叽叽喳喳的。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.0005650575392292037, "latent1_max": 0.0092574842274189, "latentT_mean": 0.00015977516081089053, "latentT_max": 0.002833870006725192, "text": "鸟儿呗，特别是那种会唱歌的。还有鱼，看着它们游得欢，心里就舒坦。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 8.41205385995106e-07, "latent1_max": 5.11019243276678e-06, "latentT_mean": 8.41205385995106e-07, "latentT_max": 5.11019243276678e-06, "text": "科幻片呗，肯定新鲜刺激。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 3.356854692849025e-07, "latent1_max": 1.97556869352411e-06, "latentT_mean": 3.356854692849025e-07, "latentT_max": 1.97556869352411e-06, "text": "鬼片呗，有刺激又有惊悚，我最爱了。你怕不怕？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.9980413831557017e-05, "latent1_max": 0.00023416227486450225, "latentT_mean": 1.9980413831557017e-05, "latentT_max": 0.00023416227486450225, "text": "这事儿跟个屁似的，我只会飞，哪懂编程。不过听人说这玩意儿能当饭吃，以后可能用得上。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 6.9905022464955025e-06, "latent1_max": 0.00015617976896464825, "latentT_mean": 6.9905022464955025e-06, "latentT_max": 0.00015617976896464825, "text": "就那么点小意思嘛，难不难我还不知道？反正我觉得挺有意思的，以后说不定能用到呢。你呢，也学过编程没？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.5248674909280324e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0006452167290262878, "latentT_mean": 2.5248674909280324e-05, "latentT_max": 0.0006452167290262878, "text": "那玩意儿又贵又麻烦，还不如多喝点儿水呢。不过我猜是那些人没朋友吧。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.7368066738444876e-06, "latent1_max": 2.8523081709863618e-05, "latentT_mean": 1.7368066738444876e-06, "latentT_max": 2.8523081709863618e-05, "text": "嗨，你这是在找借口喝咖啡吧？不过也有可能是那儿的蛋糕好吃。下次带你去，保证你爱上那个味儿。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 0, "manifest": true, "latent1_mean": 0.0435759486877545, "latent1_max": 0.9999924898147583, "latentT_mean": 0.0435759486877545, "latentT_max": 0.9999924898147583, "text": "喜欢啦，特别是树袋熊和鹦鹉，还有会飞的小生物们。你呢？最喜欢哪个鸟种？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.0005053318888852198, "latent1_max": 0.004171491600573063, "latentT_mean": 0.0005053318888852198, "latentT_max": 0.004171491600573063, "text": "喜欢啥嘛，喜欢你就多了去了。哎呀，这话听着像在骂我一样。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.5341999710874018e-06, "latent1_max": 2.1679541532648727e-05, "latentT_mean": 7.940414077081243e-06, "latentT_max": 8.254825661424547e-05, "text": "看恐怖片呗，看看鬼魂啥的！你肯定害怕得要死。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.1218089594589032e-06, "latent1_max": 9.798213795875199e-06, "latentT_mean": 9.851335165222962e-06, "latentT_max": 8.633104152977467e-05, "text": "科幻啦，或者恐怖片，选一个。我说真的，我这人不怕黑！"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.734436854373918e-06, "latent1_max": 3.553956048563123e-05, "latentT_mean": 8.642221584497087e-06, "latentT_max": 0.00013509771088138223, "text": "哎呀，你不是在骗我啊，不是想去当程序员吗？放心，难不难还真不好说，不过既然想学，就试试呗。值不值得，自己看着办吧，不就是赚工资嘛，还不是一样的！"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.0625380112694142e-06, "latent1_max": 7.549359452241333e-06, "latentT_mean": 8.44470656661267e-06, "latentT_max": 3.987071613664739e-05, "text": "嘁，这个啥都不值，就是一堆符号。不过听别人讲学它挺酷的，说不定哪天也能用上，就当费点力赚学费也值啦。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 5.445181449839036e-07, "latent1_max": 2.8743595521518728e-06, "latentT_mean": 6.122204700277832e-06, "latentT_max": 2.7309371944284067e-05, "text": "谁知道呀，可能是老板娘做的炸鸡真好吃呗。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 6.734920553815658e-07, "latent1_max": 7.761851520626806e-06, "latentT_mean": 5.024958021157292e-06, "latentT_max": 3.246389314881526e-05, "text": "谁知道啊，就是网红嘛。反正人太多，空气里都是吵闹和味道混合的味道。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.0017124460718337161, "latent1_max": 0.037234824150800705, "latentT_mean": 0.0017374266789135855, "latentT_max": 0.03351336717605591, "text": "哎呀，我嘛，就是喜欢那些会飞会叫的，像你似的就棒了！"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.3, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.0010535443142776358, "latent1_max": 0.017102116718888283, "latentT_mean": 0.000981354446704517, "latentT_max": 0.012022937647998333, "text": "我偏爱那种能让我一箭双雕的玩意儿，比如说小鸟们。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.4510339951208372e-06, "latent1_max": 2.214664527855348e-05, "latentT_mean": 3.336195371730355e-05, "latentT_max": 0.0003047714417334646, "text": "那就看恐怖的，我特能看那个，让你见识一下我的心脏有多稳定。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.00018761817669780742, "latent1_max": 0.0028451811522245407, "latentT_mean": 0.00030535228696374855, "latentT_max": 0.0033065767493098974, "text": "鬼片呗，看看那些吓人的家伙到底能不能吓住我们小菜鸟。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 2.3622873046041143e-05, "latent1_max": 0.0007972164312377572, "latentT_mean": 7.541360191819932e-05, "latentT_max": 0.0015319467056542635, "text": "编程？我觉得就是种树啊，在土里埋点儿东西就会长成啥。要不要去实践下，说不定能找出自己最喜欢的那棵树。 worthwhile值不值得投？当然值得，不然干嘛有人整天加班练啊！"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "coding", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 5.3227811775178835e-06, "latent1_max": 0.00016010578838177025, "latentT_mean": 3.8962150395532146e-05, "latentT_max": 0.0005007598083466291, "text": "编程啥玩意儿，我不懂。但我看有些人说挺有意思的，学了应该能多点办法，反正对我这外行人来说没啥用。你打算认真学嘛？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 5.428983220991807e-06, "latent1_max": 0.00010476588795427233, "latentT_mean": 3.529707934575299e-05, "latentT_max": 0.00045372004387900233, "text": "流行呗，人多好玩呗。你就说咱们得给我找点儿啥好玩的？"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "coffee", "dist": "far", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.0642199191832453e-06, "latent1_max": 1.9847078874590807e-05, "latentT_mean": 2.3017159001305168e-05, "latentT_max": 0.00028028074302710593, "text": "咖啡店就是个摆弄人的好地方，坐那儿浪费的时间就像被人牵着鼻子走一样上当受骗的感觉。别问我是怎么知道这些道理的。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.0016906974220626948, "latent1_max": 0.01890726573765278, "latentT_mean": 0.0013610173806690563, "latentT_max": 0.010231242515146732, "text": "我喜欢有个性的，像我的“老伙计”-莱娅。还有那些喜欢搞事情的小家伙，就跟人一样。"}
{"pos": "none", "temp": 1.6, "topic": "animal", "dist": "near", "sample": 1, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.000311039878725664, "latent1_max": 0.002833175240084529, "latentT_mean": 0.0010644580088009046, "latentT_max": 0.011631284840404987, "text": "我喜欢叽叽喳喳的小鸟们。它们总能给我一些快乐。"}
{"pos": "system", "temp": 0.7, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 1.3024496215979786e-05, "latent1_max": 0.00023522756237071007, "latentT_mean": 1.2985283060096722e-06, "latentT_max": 2.5482013370492496e-05, "text": "就看看那些逗比的喜剧吧，你这招能让我笑得更开心。"}
