{"pos": "system", "temp": 1.0, "topic": "movie", "dist": "far", "sample": 0, "manifest": false, "latent1_mean": 0.00027641182550406545, "latent1_max": 0.005920526571571827, "latentT_mean": 0.00027641182550406545, "latentT_max": 0.005920526571571827, "text": "能看啥看啥呗，别给我弄那些鬼片，一想起就心里发毛。"}
